ion-home-block"><div class="page-padding-v2"><div class="heading-extra-large section-title">How does it work?</div><div class="container-grid free-module"><div id="w-node-e5a38e16-13d3-93f2-80fa-5ef720667f52-21cdeba5" class="capture-process-text"><div class="capture-process-item"><div class="heading-medium numeral">1</div><div class="heading-medium">Give us a prompt</div><div class="display-body-text-regular">Provide a short description of your video. We&#x27;ll take care of the rest.</div></div><div class="capture-process-item"><div class="heading-medium numeral">2</div><div class="heading-medium">Our AI works its magic</div><div class="display-body-text-regular">We generate custom copy, eye-catching layouts and custom images, in just a few minutes.</div></div><div class="capture-process-item last"><div class="heading-medium numeral">3</div><div class="heading-medium">Get thumbnails by email</div><div class="display-body-text-regular">We&#x27;ll email you five variants so you can pick your favorite.</div></div></div><div id="w-node-e5a38e16-13d3-93f2-80fa-5ef720667f68-21cdeba5" class="ai-slider-section"><div class="ai-slider-label">Actual examples of AI generated thumbnails</div><div data-delay="4000" data-animation="slide" class="slider w-slider" data-autoplay="false" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="0" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true"><div class="w-slider-mask"><div class="w-slide"><div class="slider-slide"><img sizes="(max-width: 479px) 13vw, (max-width: 991px) 100vw, 1470px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622ffb3448f15ce7a33c6a2b/64768130aa2921923a8643d2_japancold-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622ffb3448f15ce7a33c6a2b/64768130aa2921923a8643d2_japancold-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622ffb3448f15ce7a33c6a2b/64768130aa2921923a8643d2_japancold-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/622ffb3448f15ce7a33c6a2b/6476